        "description": "Dine Corner Lite is a free WordPress theme for catering companies, event planners, cafes, and fine-dining hosts. Showcase event packages, menus, and chef services with a clean homepage hero, Events we Cater cards, header contact details, social links, flexible layouts, footer widgets, and WooCommerce support — all managed from the Customizer with live preview. Fully responsive, translation-ready, and lightweight. Upgrade to Dine Corner Pro for dish listings, chefs, testimonials, and more homepage sections."
